{"2732800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stitched Together", "steam_appid": 2732800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/4089197a366608fa3c56bc7e04677981.avif?t=1773662420\" width=562 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stitched Together</strong> is an RPG adventure with a deep story, unique battle mechanics, world-defying stakes, and a whole extra dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of <strong>Gwen Colgrave</strong> - an adventurous college student with a point to prove once she returns home. She'll stumble upon a bigger world with bigger consequences than she ever signed up for, but alongside her long-time friends, Gwen will have no choice but to save her world from being torn apart at the seams, no matter what, or who, stands in her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stitched Together</strong>, you'll progress through turn-based battles, all while leveling up, gaining experience, and growing your bonds to unlock new abilities! Explore Gwen's hometown of Flipside and many other places to meet plenty of wild and lovable characters, manipulate and transform the world around you, discover hidden secrets and collectibles, and learn more about the mysterious parallel world known as the Fabric!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/e8a91b4176a49189f8080e1738d1dbe5.poster.avif?t=1773662420\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/e8a91b4176a49189f8080e1738d1dbe5.webm?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/e8a91b4176a49189f8080e1738d1dbe5.mp4?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/2286ad5c95bba45a5d485bd0019b2ad4.avif?t=1773662420\" width=562 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the knowledge of most people, there lies a parallel world to our own called &quot;The Fabric&quot; - a perfect recreation of reality, where patchwork, textiles, and stitches build everything we know, from our towns and homes to the forests and plains of nature. Change something in the Fabric, and it changes in our world, and vice versa. With this knowledge, someone has been tearing apart the Fabric for an unknown purpose, causing both objects and events to simply disappear from reality. When Gwen and her friends learn of this disaster unfolding in the Fabric, they have no choice but to investigate the cause of the disappearances, and Gwen's unknown, unwilling connection to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/931f99c61cd41deda14b2939c40175ec.poster.avif?t=1773662420\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/931f99c61cd41deda14b2939c40175ec.webm?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/931f99c61cd41deda14b2939c40175ec.mp4?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/acc99ba7dd18334592087447413950b5.avif?t=1773662420\" width=562 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Two Lived-In and Explorable Worlds</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gwen and her friends have the special ability to travel between the real world and the Fabric at any time, and so do you! These two worlds exist in tandem, and both hold their own individual secrets, civilizations, gameplay mechanics, and more! You'll need to master switching between worlds and using their mechanics to solve environmental puzzles and progress through locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charming, Deep Characters and Stories</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's plenty to learn about Gwen, her friends, and the worlds of people and places around them! Through the party's Contacts, you can prioritize and influence the relationships of Gwen's friend group, learning about their friendships, relationships, experiences, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Engaging and Unique Battle Mechanics</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gwen and her friends rely on each other for success! With their Contacts, any two party members can team up and use abilities in battle that are unique to that pair, leading to dozens and dozens of unique Link Skills across fifteen unique collections of skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/c337c607acdfd993b0c7bbf1b1eaf17e.poster.avif?t=1773662420\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/c337c607acdfd993b0c7bbf1b1eaf17e.webm?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/c337c607acdfd993b0c7bbf1b1eaf17e.mp4?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/4089197a366608fa3c56bc7e04677981.avif?t=1773662420\" width=562 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stitched Together</strong> is an RPG adventure with a deep story, unique battle mechanics, world-defying stakes, and a whole extra dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of <strong>Gwen Colgrave</strong> - an adventurous college student with a point to prove once she returns home. She'll stumble upon a bigger world with bigger consequences than she ever signed up for, but alongside her long-time friends, Gwen will have no choice but to save her world from being torn apart at the seams, no matter what, or who, stands in her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stitched Together</strong>, you'll progress through turn-based battles, all while leveling up, gaining experience, and growing your bonds to unlock new abilities! Explore Gwen's hometown of Flipside and many other places to meet plenty of wild and lovable characters, manipulate and transform the world around you, discover hidden secrets and collectibles, and learn more about the mysterious parallel world known as the Fabric!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/e8a91b4176a49189f8080e1738d1dbe5.poster.avif?t=1773662420\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extra