img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/acc99ba7dd18334592087447413950b5.avif?t=1773662420\" width=562 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Two Lived-In and Explorable Worlds</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gwen and her friends have the special ability to travel between the real world and the Fabric at any time, and so do you! These two worlds exist in tandem, and both hold their own individual secrets, civilizations, gameplay mechanics, and more! You'll need to master switching between worlds and using their mechanics to solve environmental puzzles and progress through locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Charming, Deep Characters and Stories</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's plenty to learn about Gwen, her friends, and the worlds of people and places around them! Through the party's Contacts, you can prioritize and influence the relationships of Gwen's friend group, learning about their friendships, relationships, experiences, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Engaging and Unique Battle Mechanics</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gwen and her friends rely on each other for success! With their Contacts, any two party members can team up and use abilities in battle that are unique to that pair, leading to dozens and dozens of unique Link Skills across fifteen unique collections of skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/c337c607acdfd993b0c7bbf1b1eaf17e.poster.avif?t=1773662420\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732800/extras/c337c607acdfd993b0c7bbf1b1eaf17e.webm?t=1773662420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared